{"seq":1,"slug":"geo-service-api-contract-design","title":"地理服务 API 契约设计：bbox/tile 参数、分页、版本与缓存语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/geospatial-serving-scale-ops/geo-service-api-contract-design","wordCount":2904,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"地理服务-api-契约设计-bbox-tile-参数-分页-版本与缓存语义\">地理服务 API 契约设计：bbox/tile 参数、分页、版本与缓存语义</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-地理接口的三个契约面\">核心概念：地理接口的三个契约面</h2><p>一个地理查询服务对外开放时，接口表面只有三类参数和一类返回，但它们各自背着一套<strong>互不兼容的坐标约定</strong>，这是绝大多数线上事故的根因。跨境业务尤其明显：同一个「附近仓库」接口被美国站客户端、欧洲站合规报表和内部风控三方同时调用，任何一方按直觉传 bbox 都能拿到一个语义错误的 200。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>契约面</th>\n<th>谁来定义</th>\n<th>最常见的错误</th>\n<th>失败形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>bbox</code> 参数</td>\n<td>GeoJSON RFC 7946、OGC API - Features Part 1</td>\n<td>经纬度顺序颠倒、反经线 bbox 被误读</td>\n<td>200 + 空结果或整个地球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tile</code> 寻址</td>\n<td>Mapbox Vector Tile 2.1、OGC API - Tiles</td>\n<td>XYZ 与 TMS 的 y 轴翻转、tile 内 extent 坐标被当经纬度</td>\n<td>上下颠倒的地图、错位图层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分页与缓存</td>\n<td>RFC 9111、RFC 9457</td>\n<td>用 offset 翻空间结果、缓存键按原始 bbox 拼</td>\n<td>重复/漏记录、缓存命中率趋零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;客户端请求&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;参数面?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|bbox| C[&quot;校验: 轴序/反经线/面积&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|z/x/y| D[&quot;校验: 缩放级别/行列范围&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;规范化: 量化 or 对齐瓦片边界&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;构造缓存键 (规范化后)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{&quot;CDN/边缘命中?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|命中| H[&quot;返回 + ETag/Cache-Control&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|未命中| I[&quot;回源: PostGIS 查询&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;序列化 GeoJSON/MVT&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"客户端请求\"] --&gt; B{\"参数面?\"}\n    B --&gt;|bbox| C[\"校验: 轴序/反经线/面积\"]\n    B --&gt;|z/x/y| D[\"校验: 缩放级别/行列范围\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"规范化: 量化 or 对齐瓦片边界\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"构造缓存键 (规范化后)\"]\n    F --&gt; G{\"CDN/边缘命中?\"}\n    G --&gt;|命中| H[\"返回 + ETag/Cache-Control\"]\n    G --&gt;|未命中| I[\"回源: PostGIS 查询\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"序列化 GeoJSON/MVT\"]\n    J --&gt; H</pre><p>契约面的设计目标不是「参数好看」，而是<strong>让缓存键可枚举、让分页可重放、让版本可协商</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bbox-参数-轴序-反经线与面积护栏\">bbox 参数：轴序、反经线与面积护栏</h2><p><code>bbox</code> 的权威定义来自 GeoJSON（IETF RFC 7946 §5）：数组顺序固定为 <code>[west, south, east, north]</code>，即 <code>[minLon, minLat, maxLon, maxLat]</code>，坐标必须是 WGS84 经纬度、单位为度、经度范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>…</mo><mn>180</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-180 \\dots 180</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span></span></span></span></span>、纬度范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>…</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-90 \\dots 90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span>。这是「经度在前」——与 PostGIS 内部的 <code>ST_MakeEnvelope(minx, miny, maxx, maxy)</code> 一致，但与 WKT 里「纬度在前（lat, lon）」的轴序<strong>相反</strong>。GeoJSON 规范正文点名了该分歧并裁定：GeoJSON 用 lon/lat。</p>\n<p>OGC API - Features - Part 1: Core（OGC 17-069r4，1.0.1 版 2024-04）把 <code>bbox</code> 定为可选查询参数，允许 <strong>4 个或 6 个数</strong>：6 个数时按 <code>[minLon, minLat, minZ, maxLon, maxLat, maxZ]</code> 解释，即在第三、第六位插入高程。第二个高频错误由此而来：客户端传 6 个数但不给 z，服务端把 <code>minZ</code> 当成 <code>maxLon</code>，得到一个跨半球的矩形。正确做法是<strong>只接受 4 或 6 个数，其余一律 400</strong>。</p>\n<p>反经线（antimeridian）是第三个坑：RFC 7946 §5.2 规定跨 ±180° 的 bbox 其 <code>west</code> 必须<strong>大于</strong> <code>east</code>（从 170°E 绕到 -170°W 写作 <code>[170, -20, -170, 20]</code>）。它在不理解该约定的实现里会被读成「正向跨越」即几乎整个地球——一次「斐济/新西兰周边」查询会瞬间拉回全表。契约必须显式声明是否支持 <code>west &gt; east</code>：支持就按 RFC 7946 处理，不支持就 <code>400</code> 拒绝，绝不静默取绝对值。</p>\n<p>第四个坑是<strong>面积护栏</strong>：允许任意 bbox 意味着允许 <code>[-180, -90, 180, 90]</code>，而 OGC API - Features 允许服务器对超出实现限制的 bbox 返回错误。设目标最大返回行数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，截断前的最小面积阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≳</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\min} \\gtrsim N/\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 为图层记录密度）；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A &lt; A_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，查询注定被截断，应返回 <code>400</code> 并携带「请缩小范围或加过滤条件」，而不是返回一个悄悄被 <code>LIMIT</code> 截断的结果集——后者会让客户端把「前 1000 条」当成「全部 1000 条」。非矩形范围常改用网格集合表达，原因也在此：离散网格集合的基数可预估，见 <a href=\"../h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/grid-proximity-kring-polygon-cover\">网格化邻近计算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瓦片寻址-z-x-y-tms-与-mvt-的坐标系契约\">瓦片寻址：z/x/y、TMS 与 MVT 的坐标系契约</h2><p>瓦片接口最小化的形式是 <code>/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}</code>，但「最小化」也就意味着坐标系契约全靠约定，而约定有两个互相冲突的阵营：<strong>XYZ（Google/OSM 风格）<strong>把原点放在西北角、y 向下递增；<strong>TMS</strong>（Tile Map Service 规范，OSGeo）把原点放在西南角、y 向上递增。同一个 <code>(z, x, y)</code> 在两个方案里指向</strong>南北镜像</strong>的瓦片，换算是一个常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>TMS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>XYZ</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{\\text{TMS}} = 2^{z} - 1 - y_{\\text{XYZ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TMS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7477em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">XYZ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>OGC API - Tiles - Part 1: Core（OGC 20-057）把路径模板规范为 <code>/tiles/{tileMatrixSetId}/{tileMatrix}/{tileRow}/{tileCol}</code>，并强制把 <code>tileMatrixSetId</code> 放进 URL——这不是冗余，而是把「用哪套矩阵集、哪套原点、哪套分辨率」从隐式约定变成<strong>显式可寻址的契约维度</strong>。因此<strong>不要在 URL 里省略矩阵集标识</strong>：一旦接入另一套全球格网（例如某国测绘局的本地投影格网），整个瓦片空间的重解释会静默破坏所有已缓存的瓦片。</p>\n<p>瓦片内容的坐标契约来自 Mapbox Vector Tile Specification 2.1：MVT 的几何坐标是<strong>瓦片局部坐标</strong>，范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>extent</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, \\text{extent}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">extent</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、默认 <code>extent = 4096</code>，同样 y 向下；即 <code>(0,0)</code> 是左上角、<code>(4096,4096)</code> 是右下角，<strong>不是经纬度</strong>。把 MVT 局部坐标当经纬度返回，图层会整体错位到几内亚湾附近，所以返回格式应走内容协商（<code>Accept: application/vnd.mapbox-vector-tile</code> vs <code>application/geo+json</code>）。瓦片分辨率则决定 <strong>最大 z</strong>（超过它返回 404 而非空白瓦片）和 <strong>overzoom 策略</strong>——z 级瓦片总数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^{z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单瓦片地面分辨率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>res</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>156543.03</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{res}(z) \\approx 156543.03/2^{z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">res</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">156543.03/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 米/像素（Web Mercator、256px 瓦片），overzoom 决定 CDN 上「同一地理区域会产生多少个不同 URL」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分页-空间查询为什么不能只看-offset\">分页：空间查询为什么不能只看 offset</h2><p>OGC API - Features Part 1 定义 <code>limit</code> 与 <code>offset</code> 控制分页，并通过响应里的 <code>next</code> 链接把「下一页」变成服务端给出的 URL。传统 <code>?offset=100</code> 在空间查询上有被低估的缺陷：<strong>空间结果集的排序天然不稳定</strong>。<code>ORDER BY ST_Distance(...)</code> 在距离相等的记录之间顺序未定义，而空间索引扫描的返回顺序可能在两次执行、两个副本、甚至同一次查询的不同并行 worker 之间变化。于是「第 2 页」可能复用第 1 页的最后一条，同时永久跳过另一条。</p>\n<p>两个可用的契约策略：<strong>键集分页</strong>返回不透明的 <code>next_cursor</code>，编码上次结果的排序键末位（如 <code>(distance_micros, entity_id)</code>），下一页用 <code>WHERE (dist, id) &gt; (:last_dist, :last_id) ORDER BY dist, id LIMIT :n</code> 继续，契约要求<strong>排序键必须含唯一列</strong>以保证全序；<strong>快照分页</strong>附加 <code>as_of</code> 时间戳或事务快照 id——STAC（SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog）即采用 <code>next</code>/<code>prev</code> 链接 rel 加 <code>token</code>。契约层还必须规定<strong>上限与截断语义</strong>：<code>limit</code> 需有服务端硬上限（例如 1000），请求超过时 <code>400</code> 而非静默降级；响应体携带 <code>numberReturned</code> 与 <code>numberMatched</code>（后者用 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 行数估算即可，并标明是估算值）。<strong>分页参数必须进入缓存键，第二页之后不可缓存</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本与缓存语义-让-cdn-真的能命中\">版本与缓存语义：让 CDN 真的能命中</h2><p>地理接口的缓存不是「加个 header」，而是<strong>缓存键设计问题</strong>。CDN 默认按完整 URL 作键，而地理参数是连续浮点数：<code>bbox=116.397,39.908,...</code> 与 <code>bbox=116.3971,39.9081,...</code> 是两个不同的键，内容却几乎没有差别。不做规范化，命中率会随客户端精度抖动趋近于 0。契约层的规范化规则应显式写出并测试：<strong>bbox 量化</strong>——把每个坐标四舍五入到小数位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 并<strong>向外扩张</strong>到该精度网格（<code>floor</code> 最小值、<code>ceil</code> 最大值），保证量化后范围是原范围的超集、语义上不丢记录；量化后键空间上界是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(180 \\cdot 10^{d}) \\times (90 \\cdot 10^{d})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 每加 1 键空间乘 100。<strong>bbox 对齐瓦片边界</strong>——把 bbox 吸附到某个 z 级的瓦片边界，使请求集合变成有限可枚举的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{z,x,y\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 组合，与瓦片缓存复用同一批键。<strong>参数归零</strong>——<code>zoom</code>、<code>limit</code>、<code>format</code> 等按字典序重写 URL，缺省值不写入键。</p>\n<p>版本协商应二选一并写明于契约。<strong>URL 路径版本</strong>（<code>/v3/...</code>）简单、可缓存、CDN 规则好写，缺点是切换要改客户端；<strong>媒体类型版本协商</strong>（<code>Accept: application/geo+json;version=2</code>）符合 OGC API content negotiation 思路，但 <code>Vary: Accept</code> 会让缓存按 Accept 头分裂。对瓦片这类高 QPS 只读资源，路径版本 + 显式矩阵集标识几乎是唯一务实选择。HTTP 缓存语义由 RFC 9111 与 RFC 9110 定义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源类型</th>\n<th>推荐 <code>Cache-Control</code></th>\n<th>校验器</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矢量/栅格瓦片</td>\n<td><code>public, max-age=31536000, immutable</code></td>\n<td>强 <code>ETag</code></td>\n<td>瓦片内容按 z/x/y 与数据版本永久稳定；换版本靠换 URL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>要素查询（第一页）</td>\n<td><code>public, max-age=30, stale-while-revalidate=300</code></td>\n<td><code>ETag</code> + <code>If-None-Match</code></td>\n<td>数据会变但可短暂陈旧；<code>stale-while-revalidate</code> 来自 RFC 5861</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分页后续页 / 游标</td>\n<td><code>no-store</code></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>游标一次性，缓存无意义且易串页</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>瓦片之所以能 <code>immutable</code> 一年，前提是<strong>发布语义</strong>：任何数据变更都产出新的 URL，而不是原地覆盖旧瓦片——如果允许原地更新，<code>immutable</code> 就是错的，且客户端上的旧瓦片会永久残留。<code>ETag</code> 的选择也有讲究：对瓦片用「数据版本 + z/x/y」的哈希即可；对要素查询，若响应含时间戳或随机排序，<code>ETag</code> 会在无变化时也变化，导致 <code>If-None-Match</code> 永远不命中——所以契约应要求查询结果<strong>排序确定</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误契约与护栏\">错误契约与护栏</h2><p>错误响应必须机器可读，否则客户端只能靠字符串匹配猜。RFC 9457（Problem Details for HTTP APIs, 2023，取代 RFC 7807）的标准结构应成为契约的一部分，媒体类型 <code>application/problem+json</code>，最少含 <code>type</code>（稳定的问题分类 URI）、<code>title</code>、<code>status</code>、<code>detail</code>；地理场景值得扩展 <code>bbox</code>（回显规范化后的 bbox）与 <code>maxBboxArea</code>。护栏清单如下，每条都应能被测试用例固化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>状态码</th>\n<th>契约动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>lat/lon 反序</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>明确提示正确轴序，<strong>不自动交换</strong>——自动交换会掩盖客户端 bug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨反经线（<code>minLon &gt; maxLon</code>）</td>\n<td>400 或按 RFC 7946</td>\n<td>仅当契约声明支持时才接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积超出 <code>maxBboxArea</code></td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>OGC API - Features 允许服务器限制 bbox 范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>z</code> 越界</td>\n<td>404</td>\n<td>404 比 400 更符合「该瓦片不存在」的语义，便于 CDN 缓存负结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额耗尽</td>\n<td>429 + <code>Retry-After</code></td>\n<td>瓦片与要素查询分别配额，按 IP 与按 <code>datasetId</code> 限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>坐标精度</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>声明保留位数（RFC 7946 §11.2 反对不必要的精度；6 位约 0.11 米）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>地理服务 API 的契约设计与普通 REST 接口的差别，集中在一个事实：<strong>地理参数是连续的、有坐标约定的、且天然用于缓存</strong>。</p>\n<p><code>bbox</code> 的语义由 RFC 7946 唯一裁定——经度在前、反经线时 west 大于 east、只接受 4 或 6 个数；OGC API - Features Part 1 给了参数位的标准位置。校验层要做的是<strong>拒绝</strong>而非猜测。</p>\n<p>瓦片寻址必须把矩阵集与原点约定变成 URL 的一部分，因为 XYZ 与 TMS 的 y 轴互为镜像（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>TMS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>XYZ</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{\\text{TMS}} = 2^{z}-1-y_{\\text{XYZ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TMS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7477em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">XYZ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），而 MVT 的 extent 坐标不是经纬度。</p>\n<p>分页与缓存必须一起设计：空间排序不稳定，位置偏移量分页会漏记录，键集游标才是正确形态；缓存键必须在服务端<strong>规范化</strong>（量化 bbox 或吸附瓦片边界），否则浮点抖动会让 CDN 命中率归零；瓦片的 <code>immutable</code> 长缓存成立的前提是「数据变更换 URL」。把契约写成下面这些可被测试固化的规则，地理接口就能同时在正确性、可缓存性和可演进性上站住。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>轴序</strong>：<code>bbox</code> 严格经度在前（RFC 7946），服务端不猜测调用方的排列习惯。</li>\n<li><strong>反经线</strong>：允许 <code>west &gt; east</code> 表示跨越 ±180°，并按环带而非横跨全球的包围盒解释。</li>\n<li><strong>面积上限</strong>：对查询跨度设硬护栏，拒绝过大 bbox，防止一次请求扫穿整表。</li>\n<li><strong>y 轴方向</strong>：URL 明确 XYZ 或 TMS，二者按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>TMS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>XYZ</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{\\text{TMS}}=2^{z}-1-y_{\\text{XYZ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TMS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7477em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">XYZ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 换算，不混用。</li>\n<li><strong>extent 坐标系</strong>：MVT 用局部像素 extent 而非经纬度，瓦片与矢量坐标的转换必须显式声明。</li>\n<li><strong>游标一次性</strong>：空间分页用键集游标且不依赖易变排序，不用 offset/length 作为稳定翻页手段。</li>\n<li><strong>量化精度</strong>：缓存键在服务端按固定网格量化吸附，消除浮点抖动，命中才成立。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地理服务 API 契约设计：bbox/tile 参数、分页、版本与缓存语义","id":"地理服务-api-契约设计-bbox-tile-参数-分页-版本与缓存语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：地理接口的三个契约面","id":"核心概念-地理接口的三个契约面"},{"level":2,"text":"bbox 参数：轴序、反经线与面积护栏","id":"bbox-参数-轴序-反经线与面积护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"瓦片寻址：z/x/y、TMS 与 MVT 的坐标系契约","id":"瓦片寻址-z-x-y-tms-与-mvt-的坐标系契约"},{"level":2,"text":"分页：空间查询为什么不能只看 offset","id":"分页-空间查询为什么不能只看-offset"},{"level":2,"text":"版本与缓存语义：让 CDN 真的能命中","id":"版本与缓存语义-让-cdn-真的能命中"},{"level":2,"text":"错误契约与护栏","id":"错误契约与护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"邻近服务 API 与热格分片：边界跨格、分页与容量倾斜治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/nearby-service-api-hotcell-sharding"},"next":{"title":"空间数据摄取流水线与分区：批量 COPY、稳定 ID 与增量重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/geospatial-serving-scale-ops/spatial-ingest-pipeline-partitioning"}}